    "updated_at": "2026-11-19T19:36:29Z",
    "body": "Escalated from effort:medium to effort:high under the AGENTS.md safety floor.\nThis issue changes posted tool calls and adds a refusal for cutting tools in reserved pockets.\nThe maintainer also requires reserved tool names for Sinumerik and refusal of tool number zero.\nThese requirements affect posted G-code and need effort:high or greater.\nI stopped before the overlap check and claim. I made no code changes and ran no tests.\nThere is no held branch or worktree. The issue remains unclaimed.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
